---
description: >-
  Every agentflow shape with several edges in and out, so edge ends spread along each side:
  every end on a node must sit on that node's outline (diamond, slants, wave, rounded corners).
---
agentflow-beta TB
  connector llm["LLM API"]
  i["Input"]@{ shape: input }
  t["Task"]@{ shape: task }
  d{"Decide"}
  r["Reference"]@{ shape: refdoc }
  a["Act"]@{ shape: action }
  tl["Tool"]@{ shape: tool }
  flow box["Box"]
    x["Inside"]
  end
  box@{ view: "collapsed" }
  i --> t & d & r & a & tl & box
  t & d & r & a & tl & box --> llm
  d -->|yes| a
  d --x r
  r -.- tl
  a --> t
